{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Economy log: Wildcard rewards, the Specialization Cache and Silas Darkmoon's stores",
  "contract": [
    "With the economy log on, a Wildcard Hero's items are logged: rewards with source 8 (Wildcard), purchases as store_buy with source 10 (Wildcard store) and the price on the first row, cache contents as cache_open with the cache as source.",
    "Opening the Specialization Cache 2977359 gives five Tomes of Specialization, one each of II to VI (106954, 134980, 134981, 134982, 134983): five cache_open rows, each with a tome the character now carries and count 1. Being handed the cache itself is not logged (a once-per-account starter item).",
    "The level-10 Scroll of Fortune claim (0x6AD) gives 2 Scrolls of Fortune I 1101244 and 6 talent scrolls 97933: two reward rows.",
    "Revealing the five cards of a sealed pack 97885 pays one Darkmoon Ticket 246190 per card: one reward row for 5 tickets.",
    "Buying Starsurge 133169 from the Skill Cards store (0x6BB) for 250 Darkmoon Tickets: one store_buy row with the tickets as cost.",
    "Buying two boosters (0x6DD) for 100 gold gives 2 Golden Ability packs 778998 and 2 Golden Talent packs 97870: two store_buy rows, the first carrying the 100 gold.",
    "With full bags, one booster for 50 gold is sent by mail (Deliver posts every reward), and the mailed Golden Ability pack still carries the 50 gold, the Golden Talent pack none."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "economy_log": true,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "wild",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 10,
      "level": 1
    }
  ],
